@startuml 工作流启动和任务触发（第一部分）

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 50

participant "CommandEngine" as Engine
participant "EventBus" as EventBus
participant "FireWorker" as Worker
participant "StartHandler" as Handler
participant "RunningAction" as Action
participant "Graph" as Graph

== 工作流启动 ==

Engine -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowStartLifecycleEvent)
EventBus -> EventBus: delayEventQueue.add(event)

... 100ms后 ...

Worker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> Worker: WorkflowStartLifecycleEvent

Worker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
Handler -> Handler: 根据状态选择 WorkflowRunningStateAction
Handler -> Action: startEventAction(...)

Action -> Graph: getStartNodes()
Graph --> Action: List<TaskExecutionRunnable>

Action -> Graph: isTriggerConditionMet(task)
Graph --> Action: true

Action -> EventBus: publish(TaskStartLifecycleEvent)
EventBus -> EventBus: delayEventQueue.add(event)

Action --> Handler: 处理完成
Handler --> Worker: 处理完成

@enduml
